[{"id":179606853,"discussion_id":"02dc9d0d1b9e37f8af9028c311481e24a1fb0099","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本次 PR 修复了 `ForeachAddListTilingFunc` 中因 `perCoreElements` 对齐后未同步更新 `needCoreNum` 导致的 tiling 计算偏差问题。在对 `perCoreElements` 进行 `ALIGN_SIZE` 向上对齐后，新增一行代码重新计算 `needCoreNum`，确保核数分配与实际对齐后的每核元素量保持一致。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`needCoreNum` 对齐后重算**：在 `foreach_add_list_tiling_arch35.cpp` 的 `ForeachAddListTilingFunc` 中，`perCoreElements` 经 `ALIGN_SIZE` 向上对齐后，新增 `needCoreNum = Ops::Base::CeilDiv(totalElements, perCoreElements)` 重新计算所需核数，避免因对齐导致 `needCoreNum` 偏大而产生 tiling 错误。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-11T15:38:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-11T15:40:35+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179606857,"discussion_id":"1cd3c837dccdbe240211f2b041f8ffe5e5c3d2f7","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-11T15:38:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-11T15:55:24+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179606891,"discussion_id":"363911271c25a2e00e631998b4a50935b845936b","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://